abstract: >-
  A planar multibody numerical research prototype with simulated force-plate
  and cable-LPT observations and independent numerical benchmark controls.
  Biological validation and real paired FORCE/LPT validation are not established.
  License selection and public-release qualification are pending.
keywords:
